{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf39 ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the magical world of Beauty and the Beast, the beloved fairy tale brought to life as a captivating Hidden Object adventure. Explore richly detailed scenes, search for hidden clues, and help Belle uncover the mysteries of the enchanted castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for casual players, fairy tale fans, and families alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d GAMEPLAY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive 360\u00b0 panoramas</strong> and beautiful 3D visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous interiors</strong> packed with interactive elements and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable levels</strong> with two different item sets per scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score-based mode</strong> for players who love a competitive challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed or competitive playstyles</strong> supported</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892550/extras/100cd39795120a0852f82c4a854a9f13.avif?t=1756412785\" width=600 height=292 /></span>\ud83d\udcd6 THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant kingdom, a proud young prince is cursed by a powerful witch and turned into a beast. His once-vibrant castle is left in decay, and his heart grows cold. Years later, Belle, a kind-hearted girl, stumbles upon the forgotten castle and meets the beast face to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through courage, kindness, and love, she begins to unravel the curse and discover the man hidden within the monster.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d4a65bbe10394929ebdb771a0a0a3a442d2e249a.jpg","localized_name":"Fairy tale begins","name":"Fairy tale begins","path":"https://cdn.akam